(281,3,2,'Grape Farm (Rotanak Mondol)','ចំការទំពាំងបាយជូ','A farm tourism destination in Rotanak Mondol district with grapes, grape products, gardens, and countryside photo spots.','ចំការទំពាំងបាយជូ ស្រុករតនមណ្ឌល — ដើរបេះទំពាំង ទិញស្រា','Grape farm and vineyard-style scenery · Grape wine and juice products · Flower garden · Countryside photo stop','ចម្ការទំពាំងបាយជូរ និងទេសភាពបែបចម្ការវល្លិ|ស្រាទំពាំងបាយជូរ និងទឹកទំពាំងបាយជូរ|សួនផ្កា|កន្លែងថតរូបជនបទ','Walk through the garden · Try grape juice or farm products · Take photos · Buy local products if available','Do not pick fruit without permission · Confirm opening before a long drive · Bring water','Morning or late afternoon; harvest/product availability may vary by season.',NULL,'About 50-60 km from Battambang city in Rotanak Mondol district.','🍇','images/btb/Chamkar Mien (Mien Farm)/1.jpg','images/btb/Chamkar Mien (Mien Farm)/1.jpg',12.7500000,103.0600000,'Daily 7am-5pm','$3','2 hours','Feature: farm tourism and local grape products; useful for nature, food, and photo-focused travelers.','ដើរបេះទំពាំងបាយជូ និងស្រាទំពាំងបាយជូ','Grape Wine & Juice Sales, Grape Products, Flower Garden, Drinks','Easy',0,1,14,'2026-06-22 04:02:06','far',3.00,5.00,1.5,1,1,1,'nature,eco,food,art'),
(282,3,1,'Wat Kor Village','ភូមិវត្តគរ','A cultural tourism village in Battambang city known for century-old Khmer houses, riverside village scenery and traditional community life.','សហគមន៍ទេសចរណ៍វប្បធម៌វត្តគរ ស្ថិតនៅភូមិវត្តគរ សង្កាត់វត្តគរ ក្រុងបាត់ដំបង មានផ្ទះបុរាណអាយុកាលជាង១០០ឆ្នាំ ទេសភាពភូមិតាមមាត់ស្ទឹង និងបរិយាកាសភូមិបុរាណ។','100-year-old Khmer houses|Riverside village|Traditional community life|Cultural tourism','ផ្ទះបុរាណអាយុកាល១០០ឆ្នាំ|ទេសភាពភូមិតាមមាត់ស្ទឹង|ជីវភាពសហគមន៍បុរាណ|ទេសចរណ៍វប្បធម៌','Visit heritage houses|Walk the village lanes|Learn local stories|Take riverside photos','Ask permission before entering private houses|Respect residents and quiet areas','Morning or late afternoon.','ពេលព្រឹក ឬល្ងាច។','Located in Wat Kor commune, Battambang city. Easy by tuk-tuk, bicycle or car.','🏘️','images/btb/Wat Kor Village/1.jpg','images/btb/Wat Kor Village/1.jpg|images/btb/Wat Kor Village/2.jpg|images/btb/Wat Kor Village/3.jpg|images/btb/Wat Kor Village/4.jpg|images/btb/Wat Kor Village/5.jpg|images/btb/Wat Kor Village/6.jpg',13.0820000,103.1900000,'Daytime','Free/local fee','1-2 hours','Ancient Khmer houses and riverside village','ផ្ទះបុរាណខ្មែរ និងភូមិមាត់ស្ទឹង','Local guide|Homestay may be available|Small local food nearby','Easy',0,1,144,'2026-06-22 04:02:06','city',0.00,5.00,1.5,1,0,1,'culture,history,relax,local'),
(283,3,2,'Thvak Stream','ស្ទឹងថ្វាក','A natural stream destination with peaceful waterside views and a simple local picnic atmosphere.','ស្ទឹងថ្វាក ជាគោលដៅធម្មជាតិ មានទេសភាពដងស្ទឹង សម្រស់ធម្មជាតិអមមាត់ស្ទឹង និងកន្លែងសម្រាកលម្ហែបែបសាមញ្ញ។','Stream scenery; waterside relaxation; local nature; picnic atmosphere','ទេសភាពដងស្ទឹង; សម្រាកមាត់ទឹក; ធម្មជាតិមូលដ្ឋាន; បរិយាកាសពិសារអាហារ','Relax by the stream; take photos; bring a picnic','Keep the area clean and be careful near water','Cool morning or late afternoon','ពេលព្រឹកត្រជាក់ ឬល្ងាច','Use local transport; ask locals for the best access road.','🏞️','images/btb/Thvak Stream/1.png','images/btb/Thvak Stream/1.png|images/btb/Thvak Stream/2.png|images/btb/Thvak Stream/3.jpg|images/btb/Thvak Stream/4.png',NULL,NULL,'Daily','Free or check locally','1-2 hours','Peaceful stream scenery','ទេសភាពស្ទឹងស្ងប់ស្ងាត់','Limited local food / អាហារមូលដ្ឋានអាចមានកំណត់; picnic friendly / អាចយកអាហារទៅបាន','Easy',0,1,130,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','far',NULL,4.00,1.5,1,1,0,'nature,relax,picnic,water'),
