(285,3,2,'Kamrieng Spring','ទឹកពុះកំរៀង','A refined natural water site in Kamrieng with waterfall scenery, fruit farms, natural shade and a suspension bridge across the stream.','ទឹកពុះកំរៀង ជារមណីយដ្ឋានធម្មជាតិកែច្នៃ មានទឹកធ្លាក់ធម្មជាតិ ចម្ការផ្លែឈើ ម្លប់ឈើសម្រាក និងស្ពានយោលកាត់ស្ទឹង។','Natural water play; waterfall; fruit farms; shaded rest areas; suspension bridge','កន្លែងលេងទឹក; ទឹកធ្លាក់ធម្មជាតិ; ចម្ការផ្លែឈើ; ម្លប់ឈើសម្រាក; ស្ពានយោលកាត់ស្ទឹង','Play safely in the water; cross the suspension bridge; enjoy nature views','Watch children near water and avoid strong currents','Dry season for safer access, rainy season for stronger water','រដូវប្រាំងសម្រាប់ផ្លូវងាយ រដូវវស្សាសម្រាប់ទឹកច្រើន','Located in Kamrieng district, about 80 km from Battambang city.','💧','images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/1.png','images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/1.png|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/2.jpg|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/3.jpg|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/4.jpg|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/5.jpg|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/6.jpg|images/btb/Kamrieng Sprin/7.png',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','2-3 hours','Spring, waterfall and suspension bridge','ទឹកពុះ ទឹកធ្លាក់ និងស្ពានយោល','No fixed services / មិនទាន់មានសេវាកម្មថេរ; bring food and water / គួរយកម្ហូប និងទឹកទៅជាមួយ','Moderate',0,1,133,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','far',NULL,5.00,2.5,1,1,0,'nature,water,waterfall,relax'),
(286,3,2,'Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall','ទឹកធ្លាក់៥៣ ភ្នំព្រឹក','A mountain waterfall destination in Phnom Proek with highland views, caves, flowers, orchards and natural stone formations.','ទឹកធ្លាក់៥៣ ភ្នំព្រឹក ជាតំបន់ធម្មជាតិកែច្នៃ មានទេសភាពលើភ្នំ ទឹកជ្រោះ ល្អាងភ្នំ សួនផ្កា ចម្ការផ្លែឈើ និងដុំថ្មធម្មជាតិ។','Mountain views; natural waterfall; caves; flower garden; fruit farms; rock formations','ទេសភាពភ្នំ; ទឹកជ្រោះធម្មជាតិ; ល្អាងភ្នំ; សួនផ្កា; ចម្ការផ្លែឈើ; ដុំថ្មធម្មជាតិ','Enjoy waterfall views; take photos; camp or stay if available; shop souvenirs','Check weather and do not enter unsafe caves alone','Dry season for access, rainy season for water flow','រដូវប្រាំងសម្រាប់ផ្លូវងាយ រដូវវស្សាសម្រាប់ទឹកច្រើន','In Phnom Proek district, around 141 km from Battambang city.','⛰️','images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/1.jpg','images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/1.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/2.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/3.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/4.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/5.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/6.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/7.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/8.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/9.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/10.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','3-4 hours','Mountain waterfall, caves and flowers','ទឹកធ្លាក់ភ្នំ ល្អាង និងសួនផ្កា','Food & drink / ម្ហូបអាហារ និងភេសជ្ជៈ; camping or stay / បោះតង់ ឬស្នាក់នៅ; rest huts / តូបសម្រាក; souvenirs / វត្ថុអនុស្សាវរីយ៍','Moderate',0,1,134,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','far',NULL,7.00,3.0,1,1,1,'nature,mountain,waterfall,cave,relax'),
(287,3,5,'Sophmongkol Water Park','សួនទឹកសុភមង្គល','A family-friendly water park near Battambang city with pools, garden areas, boats, fish-feeding spots and event spaces.','សួនទឹកសុភមង្គល ជាកន្លែងកម្សាន្តកែច្នៃក្បែរក្រុងបាត់ដំបង មានសួនទឹក សួនច្បារ កន្លែងជិះទូក កន្លែងដាក់ចំណីត្រី និងទីតាំងរៀបចំកម្មវិធី។','Water park; garden; boat ride; fish feeding; family fun; event space','សួនទឹក; សួនច្បារ; ជិះទូក; ដាក់ចំណីត្រី; កម្សាន្តគ្រួសារ; ទីតាំងកម្មវិធី','Swim and play; rent costumes or boats; relax with family; host small events','Watch children around pools and follow site rules','Weekend morning or afternoon','ចុងសប្តាហ៍ ពេលព្រឹក ឬរសៀល','About 4 km from Battambang city in O Mal area.','🎪','images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/1.jpg','images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/1.jpg|images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/2.jpg|images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/3.jpg|images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/4.jpg|images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/5.jpg|images/btb/Sophmongkol Water Park/6.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','2-4 hours','Water park and family activities','សួនទឹក និងកម្សាន្តគ្រួសារ','Food & drink / ម្ហូបអាហារ និងភេសជ្ជៈ; rest huts / តូបសម្រាក; costume rental / ជួលសម្លៀកបំពាក់; boat rental / ជួលទូក','Easy',0,1,136,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','near',NULL,7.00,3.0,1,1,1,'fun,water,relax,family,food'),
(288,3,2,'Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary','ព្រែកទាល់','A floating community and bird sanctuary on the Tonle Sap, famous for waterbird watching, floating houses, fishing life and boat-based eco-tourism.','ព្រែកទាល់ ជាសហគមន៍អេកូទេសចរណ៍លើបឹងទន្លេសាប មានភូមិអណ្តែតទឹក សហគមន៍នេសាទ ផ្ទះស្នាក់ និងកន្លែងមើលសត្វស្លាបទឹកដ៏សំខាន់។','Floating village|Bird sanctuary|Fishing community|Boat trip|Homestay','ភូមិអណ្តែតទឹក|តំបន់សត្វស្លាប|សហគមន៍នេសាទ|ជិះទូក|ផ្ទះស្នាក់','Take a boat tour|Watch waterbirds|Learn fishing community life|Stay in a homestay if available','Respect wildlife|Do not throw trash in the lake|Confirm boat and weather conditions','Dry season is best for bird watching; morning trips are cooler.','រដូវប្រាំងសមស្របសម្រាប់មើលសត្វស្លាប; ដំណើរពេលព្រឹកត្រជាក់ជាង។','Travel to the Tonle Sap side of Ek Phnom district and continue by community boat.','🦅','images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/1.png','images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/1.png|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/2.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/3.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/4.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/5.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/6.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/7.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/8.jpg|images/btb/Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary/9.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Daytime','Boat/community fee','3-5 hours','Floating village and bird sanctuary','ភូមិអណ្តែតទឹក និងតំបន់សត្វស្លាប','Boat service|Local guide|Homestay|Community food may be available','Moderate',0,1,143,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','far',0.00,8.00,4.0,1,0,1,'nature,eco,culture,water,bird'),
(289,3,1,'Battambang Historical Museum','សារមន្ទីរប្រវត្តិសាស្រ្តខេត្តបាត់ដំបង','A provincial historical museum in Battambang city housed in an old heritage building, displaying Khmer antiquities, architecture, garden space and local history.','សារមន្ទីរប្រវត្តិសាស្រ្តខេត្តបាត់ដំបង ស្ថិតនៅភូមិកម្មករ សង្កាត់ស្វាយប៉ោ ក្រុងបាត់ដំបង មានអគារចំណាស់ជាង១០០ឆ្នាំ អតីតផ្ទះលោកម្ចាស់ សួនច្បារ សម្ភារៈបុរាណខ្មែរ និងតម្លៃស្ថាបត្យកម្ម។','Historic building over 100 years old|Former governor residence|Khmer antiquities|Garden|Architecture','អគារចំណាស់ជាង១០០ឆ្នាំ|អតីតផ្ទះលោកម្ចាស់|សម្ភារៈបុរាណខ្មែរ|សួនច្បារ|ស្ថាបត្យកម្ម','View Khmer antiquities|Learn Battambang history|Explore the garden and old architecture','Do not touch artifacts|Follow museum rules|Ask before taking photos if required','Morning or afternoon on opening days.','ពេលព្រឹក ឬរសៀលនៅថ្ងៃបើក។','Located in Svay Por, Battambang city, easy by tuk-tuk, car or walking from central areas.','🏛️','images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/1.jpg','images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/1.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/2.png|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/3.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/4.png|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/5.png|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/6.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/7.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/7.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/9.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Historical Museum/10.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','1-2 hours','Khmer antiquities and historic architecture','សម្ភារៈបុរាណខ្មែរ និងស្ថាបត្យកម្មប្រវត្តិសាស្រ្ត','Guide may be available|Nearby city food and drink','Easy',0,1,146,'2026-06-23 04:19:17','city',0.00,5.00,1.5,1,0,1,'culture,history,museum,art'),
(290,3,2,'Phnom Prampi 100 Caves','ល្អាង ១០០ ភ្នំប្រាំពីរ','A natural cave destination at Phnom Prampi with mountain scenery, many cave chambers and traces of former hilltop military use.','ល្អាង ១០០ ភ្នំប្រាំពីរ ជារមណីយដ្ឋានធម្មជាតិក្នុងស្រុកភ្នំព្រឹក មានល្អាងធម្មជាតិ ទេសភាពជួរភ្នំ និងស្លាកស្នាមបន្ទាយទ័ពលើកំពូលភ្នំ។','Natural cave system; mountain range views; hilltop history; adventure feel','ល្អាងធម្មជាតិ; ទេសភាពជួរភ្នំ; ប្រវត្តិបន្ទាយទ័ពលើភ្នំ; បទពិសោធន៍ផ្សងព្រេង','Explore cave viewpoints; take nature photos; go with a local guide','Do not enter dark caves without a guide or light','Dry season and morning','រដូវប្រាំង និងពេលព្រឹក','Located at Phnom Prampi village, Bour commune, Phnom Proek district.','🕳️','images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/4.png','images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/1.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/2.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/3.png|images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/4.png|images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/5.jpg|images/btb/Phnom Prampi 100 Caves/6.png',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','2-3 hours','Caves and mountain scenery','ល្អាង និងទេសភាពជួរភ្នំ','Limited services / សេវាកំណត់; bring food and water / គួរយកម្ហូប និងទឹកទៅជាមួយ','Challenging',0,1,126,'2026-06-24 09:08:58','far',NULL,5.00,2.5,0,1,0,'nature,mountain,cave,adventure'),
(291,3,7,'Ou Tong Durian Farm','ចំការទុរេនអូរតង','A countryside fruit-farm destination around Ou Tong with stream scenery, seasonal durian and orchard landscapes.','ចំការទុរេនអូរតង ជាតំបន់កសិទេសចរណ៍ មានទេសភាពអមដងស្ទឹង ចម្ការទុរេន និងបរិយាកាសជនបទសម្រាប់សម្រាក។','Durian farm; stream scenery; orchard views; countryside relaxation','ចំការទុរេន; ទេសភាពដងស្ទឹង; ចម្ការផ្លែឈើ; សម្រាកបែបជនបទ','Visit the orchard; taste seasonal durian; enjoy stream views','Ask owners before entering farm areas or picking fruit','Durian season and morning','រដូវទុរេន និងពេលព្រឹក','Travel by local road; confirm access during rainy season.','🍈','images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/11.jpg','images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/1.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/2.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/3.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/4.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/5.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/6.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/7.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/8.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/9.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/10.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/11.jpg|images/btb/Ou Tong Durian Farm/12.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Seasonal','Check locally','1-2 hours','Durian farm and stream scenery','ចំការទុរេន និងទេសភាពដងស្ទឹង','Seasonal fruit / ផ្លែឈើតាមរដូវ; Food &amp; drink may be limited / អាហារអាចមានកំណត់','Easy',0,1,131,'2026-06-24 09:08:58','far',NULL,6.00,1.5,1,1,0,'food,nature,farm,relax'),
(292,3,2,'Nokor Chum Phnom Pruek','នគរជុំភ្នំព្រឹក','A roadside highland viewpoint and rest stop in Phnom Proek with mountain scenery, varied landscapes, food, camping and souvenir services.','នគរជុំភ្នំព្រឹក ជាគោលដៅធម្មជាតិកែច្នៃនៅស្រុកភ្នំព្រឹក មានទេសភាពពីចង្កេះភ្នំ ស្ថានីយ៍ឈប់សម្រាក ម្ហូបអាហារ បោះតង់ និងវត្ថុអនុស្សាវរីយ៍។','Highland viewpoint; roadside station; varied mountain scenery; camping; souvenirs','ទេសភាពពីចង្កេះភ្នំ; ស្ថានីយ៍ឈប់សម្រាក; ទេសភាពសម្បូរបែប; បោះតង់; វត្ថុអនុស្សាវរីយ៍','Stop for mountain views; eat local food; camp if available; buy souvenirs','Confirm camping and road conditions before travel','Morning or late afternoon','ពេលព្រឹក ឬល្ងាច','In Phnom Proek district, around 137 km via NR5 and local roads.','⛰️','images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/1.jpg','images/btb/Phnom Pruek 53 Waterfall/1.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','1-2 hours','Highland viewpoint and roadside rest stop','ទេសភាពចង្កេះភ្នំ និងកន្លែងឈប់សម្រាក','Food & drink / ម្ហូបអាហារ និងភេសជ្ជៈ; camping / បោះតង់; souvenirs / វត្ថុអនុស្សាវរីយ៍','Easy',0,1,135,'2026-06-24 09:08:58','far',NULL,6.00,1.5,1,1,1,'nature,mountain,relax,food'),
