(300,3,2,'Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community','សហគមន៍អេកូទេសចរណ៍តាតោក អូរក្រូច','A community eco-tourism area in Samlout district with forest and mountain scenery, natural waterfalls, agritourism and night firefly viewing.','សហគមន៍អេកូទេសចរណ៍តាតោក អូរក្រូច ស្ថិតនៅភូមិតាតោក និងភូមិអូរក្រូច ឃុំតាតោក ស្រុកសំឡូត មានទេសភាពព្រៃភ្នំ ទឹកធ្លាក់ធម្មជាតិ កសិទេសចរណ៍ និងការទស្សនាហ្វូងអំពិលអំពែកពេលរាត្រី។','Forest and mountain scenery|Natural waterfall|Agritourism|Firefly viewing at night|Community guide','ទេសភាពព្រៃភ្នំ|ទឹកធ្លាក់ធម្មជាតិ|កសិទេសចរណ៍|ទស្សនាហ្វូងអំពិលអំពែកពេលរាត្រី|អ្នកណែនាំសហគមន៍','Ride a community ox-cart or local transport to the waterfall|Visit farms|Watch fireflies at night|Walk with a local guide','Confirm guide and transport first|Bring water and insect protection|Avoid waterfall trails during heavy rain','Dry season for access; night visits are best for fireflies.','រដូវប្រាំងសម្រាប់ផ្លូវងាយ; ពេលរាត្រីសមស្របសម្រាប់មើលអំពិលអំពែក។','About 90 km from Battambang city in Samlout district. Arrange transport with the community before going.','🌳','images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/1.jpg','images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/1.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/2.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/3.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/4.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/5.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/6.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/7.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/8.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/9.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/10.jpg|images/btb/Tatok Or Kroch Eco-Tourism Community/11.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Daytime / night by arrangement','Community/local fee','3-4 hours','Community eco-tourism, waterfalls and fireflies','អេកូទេសចរណ៍សហគមន៍ ទឹកធ្លាក់ និងអំពិលអំពែក','Local guide|Ox-cart/local transport to waterfall|Community services|Bring food and water','Moderate',0,1,145,'2026-06-24 10:13:00','far',0.00,5.00,3.5,1,1,0,'nature,eco,waterfall,farm,adventure,nightlife'),
(301,3,1,'Battambang Provincial Museum','សារមន្ទីរខេត្តបាត់ដំបង','A provincial museum in Battambang city preserving local artifacts, cultural objects, history displays and community heritage for visitors who want a short educational stop.','សារមន្ទីរខេត្តបាត់ដំបង ជាគោលដៅវប្បធម៌នៅក្រុងបាត់ដំបង សម្រាប់សិក្សាពីវត្ថុបុរាណ សម្ភារៈវប្បធម៌ ប្រវត្តិសាស្រ្តមូលដ្ឋាន និងបេតិកភណ្ឌខេត្ត។','Local history displays|Khmer cultural objects|Provincial heritage|City museum|Educational stop','ការបង្ហាញប្រវត្តិសាស្រ្តមូលដ្ឋាន|សម្ភារៈវប្បធម៌ខ្មែរ|បេតិកភណ្ឌខេត្ត|សារមន្ទីរក្រុង|កន្លែងសិក្សា','View local exhibits|Learn Battambang history|Take a short educational visit|Combine with nearby city heritage','Do not touch artifacts|Follow museum rules|Ask before taking photos if required','Morning or afternoon on opening days.','ពេលព្រឹក ឬរសៀលនៅថ្ងៃបើក។','Located in Battambang city. Easy by tuk-tuk, car or walking from central areas.','🏛️','images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/1.jpg','images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/1.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/2.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/3.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/4.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/5.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/6.jpg|images/btb/Battambang Provincial Museum/7.jpg',NULL,NULL,'Check locally','Check locally','1-2 hours','Provincial heritage and cultural exhibits','បេតិកភណ្ឌខេត្ត និងការតាំងបង្ហាញវប្បធម៌','Guide may be available|Nearby city food and drink','Easy',0,1,147,'2026-06-25 03:46:57','city',0.00,5.00,1.5,1,0,1,'culture,history,museum,art,city');
